    id: 13, category: "social", subcategory: "Social Media Case Study", platforms: ["Instagram", "TikTok"],
    source: "Marketing Brew", date: "July 23, 2026",
    title: "How yogurt brand Sourmilk is making its mark on- and offline",
    titleZh: "酸奶品牌 Sourmilk 如何在线上线下建立影响力",
    summary: "Sourmilk combines founder-led storytelling, deliberately provocative IRL product drops and separate founder and brand accounts to build demand before expanding retail distribution.",
    summaryZh: "Sourmilk 通过创始人内容、刻意制造话题的线下产品派发，以及相互区分的创始人与品牌账号，在扩大零售铺货前先建立需求。",
    digest: "Sourmilk could not use direct-to-consumer shipping as an easy testing channel because fresh yogurt has a limited shelf life. Instead, its founders built demand before retail by delivering more than 8,000 preordered yogurts around New York and turning the distribution constraint into an intentionally provocative “drug deal” story. Founder Kiki Couchman’s personal Instagram and TikTok accounts show the behind-the-scenes reality of building the company, while the brand account handles product information, feedback and event updates. Her personal audience is more than twice the size of the brand’s following, giving Sourmilk two distinct discovery routes. Offline activations—guerilla grocery drops, fitness-studio pop-ups and collaborations with local food brands—are designed to generate moments worth capturing on social. The strategy also produces practical business intelligence: early-access sign-ups have built an email list of about 5,000 people with ZIP-code data that helps guide retail expansion. Sourmilk’s system demonstrates how founder access, physical proximity and social documentation can work together when a young brand cannot rely on conventional ecommerce growth.",
    digestZh: "由于新鲜酸奶保质期有限，Sourmilk 无法把 DTC 配送当作轻松的市场测试渠道。创始团队因此先在零售铺货前建立需求：他们在纽约配送了超过 8,000 份预订酸奶，并把配送限制包装成刻意制造话题的“街头交易”故事。创始人 Kiki Couchman 的 Instagram 和 TikTok 个人账号展示创业幕后，品牌账号则负责产品信息、反馈与活动通知。她的个人受众规模超过品牌账号两倍，为 Sourmilk 形成两条不同的发现路径。游击式杂货投放、健身工作室快闪和本地食品品牌合作等线下活动，都被设计成适合社交记录的时刻。这套策略还产生实际商业情报：早鸟名单积累约 5,000 名订阅者及邮编数据，帮助决定零售扩张区域。这个案例展示了当年轻品牌无法依赖传统电商增长时，创始人连接、线下接触与社交记录如何协同。",
